[I] Library that contains several hash-map implementations

[T] sparsehash contains several C++ hash map and set implementations with an
[T] API similar to SGI's hash_map but different performance characteristics.
[T] sparse_hash_map uses only 1-2 bits of overhead per entry, while
[T] dense_hash_map is very fast, particularly on lookup.

[U] https://github.com/sparsehash/sparsehash

[A] Sparsehash Authors
